category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"French, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"I3Uy20BKx7G-Fzz6hLIeWg","review_id":"h5hiRNDJRi4ptw-vJFQ21w","date":"2015-12-11T16:59:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9543065428733826,"text_excerpt":"Every time I come to NOLA I plan out my meals like a crazy person. I search and plan and make my choice, then I drool over the menu for weeks before I get there. This time my choice was Restaurant August. I love French food, I love tasting menus, I dig places owned by fancy TV chefs...so I was pumped. I made a reservation for 5 and we were seated immediately upon arrival in what appeared to be the main dining room. There were other dining areas too, but this one had high ceilings, hardwood floors, and beautiful crystal chandeliers. This place was swaaaannnnkkkyyy! I felt fancier just being there. Business casual seems to be the dress code and some were even more dressed than that, but I t..."},{"business_id":"I3Uy20BKx7G-Fzz6hLIeWg","review_id":"u8I_E5T_uUUhIl4Yve52NQ","date":"2017-04-06T02:57:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9509814381599426,"text_excerpt":"I had one of my most incredible meals anywhere at John Besh's Restaurant August. The restaurant is absolutely beautiful. Not surprisingly, it has a dress code. You can probably get away with business casual. Nevertheless, I wore my suit, without a tie, to comfortably fit in with the rest of the diners. The food was absolutely perfect. All the ingredients were fresh and cooked perfectly. The amazing sauces and flavors were the most significant differentiators of Restaurant August with any other restaurant. My meal was started with a complimentary amuse bouche. It was a hallowed out egg shell with a popcorn parmesan garlic mousse bottom, sweet corn custard center, and hominy crispy topping...."},{"business_id":"I3Uy20BKx7G-Fzz6hLIeWg","review_id":"g7SM9BpUrOq_SBil9jBuJw","date":"2013-03-19T16:27:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9480645656585693,"text_excerpt":"Ah - Restaurant August. This was the best meal of our trip - thank goodness I wisely saved it for our last night in NOLA. We had a fabulous meal here - I am still dreaming (and drooling) about it. I will start with my one complaint. I spoke with the hostess a couple days ahead of time and asked to not be seated by the door. She said no problem. When we arrived that night (and were made to wait in the bar for a few minutes despite our table being ready for us) the hostess stated that she was aware of my request, but that our table was, indeed, by the door. (eye roll) Oh well - moving on. The dining room is gorgeous. I love the combination of the exposed bricks with the chandeliers. Very ta..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"I3Uy20BKx7G-Fzz6hLIeWg","photo_id":"pgm0eBR6hvQXjbFCf5EXjw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pgm0eBR6hvQXjbFCf5EXjw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8888639211654663},{"business_id":"I3Uy20BKx7G-Fzz6hLIeWg","photo_id":"bJFXLXvWEN1YP9D9H9uo-A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/bJFXLXvWEN1YP9D9H9uo-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8683954477310181},{"business_id":"I3Uy20BKx7G-Fzz6hLIeWg","phot